arma","tag":"Detox","text":"Complete purification programme of 7 to 21 days.","image":{"src":"/themes/arogya-ayurveda/scene-1.svg","alt":"Panchakarma"},"href":"/treatments"},{"title":"Abhyanga","tag":"Massage","text":"Warm herbal oil massage for relaxation.","image":{"src":"/themes/arogya-ayurveda/scene-2.svg","alt":"Abhyanga"},"href":"/treatments"},{"title":"Shirodhara","tag":"Stress relief","text":"Warm oil therapy for sleep and calm.","image":{"src":"/themes/arogya-ayurveda/scene-3.svg","alt":"Shirodhara"},"href":"/treatments"}]}},{"type":"testimonials","props":{"heading":"What our clients say","items":[{"quote":"My knee pain reduced so much after janu basti. I walk freely now.","author":"Kamla Devi","role":"Patient"},{"quote":"Panchakarma gave me energy I had not felt in years.","author":"Rohit Bhatia","role":"Patient"},{"quote":"Genuine care and very peaceful atmosphere.","author":"Sarah Thomas","role":"Patient from the UK"}]}},{"type":"cta","props":{"heading":"Treating the root, not just the symptoms","body":"14-day Panchakarma programme · Limited seats","button":{"label":"Book consultation","href":"/contact"}}}]},{"title":"About","slug":"about","sections":[{"type":"page-header","props":{"eyebrow":"About us","title":"Treating the root, not just the symptoms","text":"Every treatment begins with nadi pariksha and a detailed consultation. Our vaidyas design a plan of therapies, diet and herbal medicine to restore balance between body and mind.","image":{"src":"/themes/arogya-ayurveda/place-2.svg","alt":"Arogya Ayurveda Kendra"}}},{"type":"photo-points","props":{"eyebrow":"Our approach","title":"Why choose Arogya","text":"Authentic, safe and personal.","image":{"src":"/themes/arogya-ayurveda/place-3.svg","alt":"Why choose Arogya"},"points":[{"title":"Qualified vaidyas","text":"BAMS and MD (Ayurveda) doctors.","icon":"leaf"},{"title":"Classical methods","text":"Treatments as per Ayurvedic texts.","icon":"flower"},{"title":"Herbal medicines","text":"Made from qualit